# Coverage.py
.coverage
htmlcov/
reports/

# Copier
*.rej

# Data
*.csv*
*.dat*
*.pickle*
*.xls*
*.zip*
data/
# Exception: src/gymact/gyms/data/ holds real, bundled, dated snapshots
# (Azure/GCP cloud topology, gymact.gyms.cloud_topology) that are part of
# the shipped package, not generated/local scratch data -- must be
# tracked, or the bundled-snapshot design silently breaks on a fresh
# clone (tests would fail with "real snapshot missing").
!src/gymact/gyms/data/
!src/gymact/gyms/data/*.json

